  "notes": "She has three builds in KQM (Hyperbloom, Quicken, pure healer) and two in Game8 (Hyperbloom, healer). The card follows the Hyperbloom build, which both put first: EM on all slots, 4pc Flower of Paradise Lost (KQM also Gilded Dreams, Thundering Fury and Deepwood Memories), Freedom-Sworn first. The healer build (HP%, Healing Bonus, 4pc Tenacity of the Millelith, Key of Khaj-Nisut) is kept in the lists. Her damage lines (the kit's 'check' lines show a plain percentage with no stat named) are small, and her Burst's damage is Max HP-based; her value is the EM-driven Hyperbloom, so the scaling stat is EM. ER 140 sits in KQM's 20s-rotation range at C0 (130-140) and below its 15s range (160-170); with Raiden it is 100. Neither source gives other goals.",
